#: ../../../__w/calibre/calibre/manual/xpath.rst:109
msgid "name()"
msgstr "name()"

#: ../../../__w/calibre/calibre/manual/xpath.rst:111
msgid "The name of the current tag."
msgstr "Názov aktuálnej značky."

#: ../../../__w/calibre/calibre/manual/xpath.rst:112
msgid "contains()"
msgstr "contains()"

#: ../../../__w/calibre/calibre/manual/xpath.rst:114
msgid "``contains(s1, s2)`` returns `true` if s1 contains s2."
msgstr "``contains(s1, s2)`` vráti `true`, ak s1 obsahuje s2."

#: ../../../__w/calibre/calibre/manual/xpath.rst:115
msgid "re:test()"
msgstr "re:test()"

#: ../../../__w/calibre/calibre/manual/xpath.rst:117
msgid ""
"``re:test(src, pattern, flags)`` returns `true` if the string `src` matches "
"the regular expression `pattern`. A particularly useful flag is ``i``, it "
"makes matching case insensitive. A good primer on the syntax for regular "
"expressions can be found at `regexp syntax "
"<https://docs.python.org/library/re.html>`_"
msgstr "``re:test(src, pattern, flags)`` vráti `true`, ak reťazec `src` zodpovedá regulárnemu výrazu `pattern`. Obzvlášť užitočný príznak je ``i``, ktorý zabezpečí, že zhoda nerozlišuje veľkosť písmen. Dobrý úvod do syntaxe regulárnych výrazov nájdete na `syntax regulárnych výrazov <https://docs.python.org/library/re.html>`_"
